{"seq":3,"slug":"distribution-failure-and-reconciliation","title":"分发失败与对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-approval-distribution/distribution-failure-and-reconciliation","wordCount":2754,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"分发失败与对账\">分发失败与对账</h1><p>一次价格分发的失败很少表现为漂亮的 5xx。它更常见的样子是：平台接受了 <code>PUT</code>，回你 <code>202 Accepted</code>，三天后运营发现某个 listing 被&quot;价格不实&quot;下架；经销商门户上的价目表其实还是上个月的 PDF；Shopify 侧因为一次币种切换，所有固定价静默消失了。<strong>分发失败与对账要解决的核心问题，是把&quot;我以为发出去了&quot;和&quot;渠道此刻实际是什么&quot;这两件事持续对齐</strong>——分发在<a href=\"price-list-distribution-and-channel-sync\">价目表向渠道分发与同步</a>里讲的是正向链路，本文只讲反向：错了怎么办、缺了怎么补、漂移了怎么发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-投递-生效与收敛是三件事\">核心概念：投递、生效与收敛是三件事</h2><p>**投递（delivery）**是&quot;请求被对端接收&quot;，**生效（effectiveness）**是&quot;渠道侧实际值已改变&quot;，**收敛（convergence）**是&quot;回读值已与快照目标值在容忍域内一致&quot;。三者层层递进却常被合并成一个&quot;已发布&quot;标志。本文主张的故障域纪律是：只信回读，不信返回码；只做幂等重试，不做盲目重发；只对有意义的错误重试，其余进死信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败的五种形态-从硬失败到静默漂移\">失败的五种形态：从硬失败到静默漂移</h2><p>把&quot;分发失败&quot;当成一个布尔状态是第一个设计错误。跨失败域的现实里，失败至少有五个可区分的形态，每种对应不同的检测手段与处置路径。</p>\n<p><strong>硬失败（hard failure）</strong>：连接被拒、凭证过期、HTTP 4xx 明确拒绝。特征是有明确错误码，可立即重试或告警，最容易处理。<strong>软失败（soft failure）</strong>：请求已到达、渠道已接收、但对端<strong>异步校验后拒绝</strong>——这正是平台 feed 模型的典型行为。Amazon SP-API 的价格更新走批量 Feeds 接口异步提交，处理结果要事后读 <a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference\">Feeds 处理报告与 <code>processingStatus</code></a> 才能得知，投递成功绝不等于生效。</p>\n<p><strong>超时不确定（indeterminate）</strong>：请求发出但响应丢失。此时<strong>超时从不等于没发生</strong>——对端可能已生效。这类失败禁止盲目重发，必须先用幂等键或回读消歧。<strong>静默漂移（silent drift）</strong>：渠道主动或被动改写了价格。Google Merchant Center 明确把&quot;feed 数据与落地页冲突&quot;列为导致 disapprove、limited eligibility、错误展示的常见原因（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112\">Google Merchant Center 商品数据规范</a>）；渠道不会通知源系统它改了价。<strong>部分成功（partial）</strong>：一次批量里 200 条成功、37 条失败，若系统只记一个&quot;批次失败&quot;，这 37 条的定位成本会在争议时才暴露。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败形态</th>\n<th>可检测信号</th>\n<th>是否可直接重试</th>\n<th>处置路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬失败</td>\n<td>4xx/连接错误码</td>\n<td>是（同幂等键）</td>\n<td>退避重试 → 超限入死信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软失败</td>\n<td>异步处理报告的 rejected/error</td>\n<td>否（须先改载荷）</td>\n<td>解析报告 → 修正 → 重新分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时不确定</td>\n<td>无响应 / 网关超时</td>\n<td>否（先回读消歧）</td>\n<td>回读比对 → 一致则收敛，否则重发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静默漂移</td>\n<td>周期性回读比对</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>告警 → 覆盖 / 回灌 / 接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分成功</td>\n<td>逐目标 ack 矩阵</td>\n<td>仅失败子集</td>\n<td>保留成功项，只重投失败项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"幂等键-让重试不变成重复写入\">幂等键：让重试不变成重复写入</h2><p>重试的前置条件是幂等。对价格这种&quot;最后一次写入即当前值&quot;的资源，重试若被对端当成新写入，会产生多余的层级记录、审计噪声，甚至触发渠道的风控。</p>\n<p>幂等键的构造原则是<strong>由目标状态导出，而不是由请求导出</strong>。正确形态是 <code>hash(snapshot_id ‖ channel ‖ scope)</code>：同一份快照发往同一渠道作用域，无论重试多少次，键都相同；而新快照天然产生新键，不会互相吞并。用时间戳或请求 id 作键是典型反模式——每次重试都成了新写入，幂等形同虚设。业界成熟实现（如 Stripe 的 idempotency key，服务端保留窗口为 24 小时）表明幂等键是<strong>有生命周期的</strong>：去重只在窗口内成立（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests\">Stripe Idempotent Requests</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>dedup</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>key</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dedup}(k) = \\big[ \\exists\\, w \\in W : w.\\text{key} = k \\ \\wedge\\ t_{\\text{now}} - w.t \\le \\tau \\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dedup</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">key</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 即去重窗口。窗口短于对端的最长重试链，就会出现&quot;重试已越过窗口、被当成新写入&quot;的漏网。窗口长度必须 ≥ 本系统最大重试时长与对端处理延迟之和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退避-抖动与死信队列\">退避、抖动与死信队列</h2><p>重试策略若用固定间隔，会在渠道限流时制造同步的重试风暴——所有失败目标在同一毫秒再次撞上同一限流器。正确做法是指数退避叠加抖动（jitter），这是 AWS 架构博客推荐的抗拥塞标准模式（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/\">Exponential Backoff And Jitter</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>δ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min\\big(t_{\\max},\\ t_0 \\cdot 2^{n}\\big) \\cdot \\big(1 + \\delta\\big), \\qquad \\delta \\sim U(0, j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是第几次重试，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动幅度。<strong>但重试不能无限。</strong> 当一个错误既有明确处理报告、又多次重试仍被拒（典型是软失败——载荷本身不合法），继续重试毫无意义，只会掩盖问题。此时应把该目标移入<strong>死信队列（DLQ）</strong>：一条带完整上下文（快照 id、渠道、载荷、历次错误码、最后回读值）的待人工/待修正记录，并在监控上以独立指标暴露，而不是让它悄悄烂在重试队列里。</p>\n<p>判据可以形式化为&quot;重试是否有意义&quot;：若错误的性质是<strong>确定性拒绝</strong>（同载荷必然再次被拒），入死信；若是<strong>瞬时性失败</strong>（限流、超时、连接抖动），退避重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账-以渠道回读为基线\">对账：以渠道回读为基线</h2><p>对账的全部意义在于把&quot;投递返回码&quot;降格为<strong>提示</strong>，把&quot;渠道回读值&quot;升格为<strong>证据</strong>。这一步是整条链路上最容易被省略、也最不该省略的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[分发记录&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_id + 渠道 + 幂等键] --&gt; B[生成对账批次]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逐渠道回读当前生效价 p_hat]&#10;    C --&gt; D{与快照目标价&lt;br/&gt;比较}&#10;    D --&gt;|差值 &lt;= epsilon 且 ack ok| E[收敛 记入基线]&#10;    D --&gt;|差值 &gt; epsilon| F[差异分类]&#10;    D --&gt;|回读为空/不存在| G[缺失 视为未分发]&#10;    F --&gt; H{可判定归因?}&#10;    H --&gt;|渠道侧被改价| I[漂移: 覆盖 或 回灌源系统]&#10;    H --&gt;|取整/汇率/税差| J[误差域内 接受并调标定]&#10;    H --&gt;|无法归因| K[告警 + 人工工单]&#10;    G --&gt; L[重新分发 或 排查渠道侧可见性]\">flowchart TD\n    A[分发记录&lt;br/&gt;snapshot_id + 渠道 + 幂等键] --&gt; B[生成对账批次]\n    B --&gt; C[逐渠道回读当前生效价 p_hat]\n    C --&gt; D{与快照目标价&lt;br/&gt;比较}\n    D --&gt;|差值 &lt;= epsilon 且 ack ok| E[收敛 记入基线]\n    D --&gt;|差值 &gt; epsilon| F[差异分类]\n    D --&gt;|回读为空/不存在| G[缺失 视为未分发]\n    F --&gt; H{可判定归因?}\n    H --&gt;|渠道侧被改价| I[漂移: 覆盖 或 回灌源系统]\n    H --&gt;|取整/汇率/税差| J[误差域内 接受并调标定]\n    H --&gt;|无法归因| K[告警 + 人工工单]\n    G --&gt; L[重新分发 或 排查渠道侧可见性]</pre><p>对账批次的选取有讲究。全量回读成本过高，增量回读会漏掉&quot;曾经同步过、后来被渠道改掉&quot;的目标——因此正确基线是<strong>自上次对账以来所有变更过快照的 (渠道, 作用域) 对</strong>，加上一个低频的全量巡检兜底。这与<a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/price-list-versioning-and-snapshot\">价格版本模型与快照</a>的概念直接相关：只有快照被冻结，回读值才有唯一可比的目标。</p>\n<p>收敛判定必须在<strong>容忍域</strong>内进行，而非精确相等。渠道的取整、本币换算、税口径差异都会让回读值与源值带一个可解释的偏差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>converged</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>ack</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>ok</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{converged}(c) = \\big[\\text{ack}(c) = \\text{ok}\\big] \\ \\wedge\\ \\big| \\hat{p}_c - p_{\\text{target}}(c) \\big| \\le \\varepsilon_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">converged</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ack</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ok</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取零会制造大量假告警（每个分位取整都报漂移），取太大则放过真实事故。它应按渠道与币种分别标定，并在发现新误差模式时更新——这正是&quot;对账&quot;与&quot;调参&quot;的耦合点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异分类学-覆盖-回灌还是接受\">差异分类学：覆盖、回灌还是接受</h2><p>对账一旦跑起来，真正的工作量在<strong>差异归因</strong>。没有归因，对账只会变成告警洪水；有了归因，每条差异都有唯一正确的处置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>是否需人工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渠道侧被人工改价</td>\n<td>平台运营临时促销、经销商擅自加价</td>\n<td>覆盖（重发快照）或回灌（接受并更新源）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种/固定价丢失</td>\n<td>改 price list 币种时固定价被清空、回退到调整规则</td>\n<td>重发固定价</td>\n<td>是（须先定位）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取整与换算误差</td>\n<td>平台分位取整、本币换算、含税/不含税口径</td>\n<td>接受，纳入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 标定</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率陈旧</td>\n<td>汇率表未随快照更新</td>\n<td>重算并重发本币价</td>\n<td>否（自动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失（不存在）</td>\n<td>分发未达、渠道侧可见性被关</td>\n<td>重发 / 排查可见性</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Shopify 的 price list 模型里有一个极隐蔽的差异源：<strong>修改 price list 的币种会移除所有固定价</strong>，受影响的变体随即回退到基于调整规则的相对价格（<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/PriceList\">Shopify PriceList</a>）。这意味着一次看似无关的配置变更，会让渠道上一批&quot;已收敛&quot;的价格静默变成另一个值——只有周期性回读对账能发现它。同理，多币种体系的三个层次（presentment / shop / settlement currency）在换算上并不严格相等：Shopify 明确说明 shop currency 是从 presentment 金额用实时汇率反算的，<strong>换算后的子总额不一定精确吻合</strong>（<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/markets\">Shopify Markets</a>）。这不是 bug，是必须被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 吸收的固有误差。</p>\n<p>更进一步，渠道侧价格从来不是源系统价格的纯函数。Shopify 直接要求应用<strong>不得从基础变体价推算国际市场价</strong>，必须显式读取市场上下文价——因为渠道侧存在源系统并不知晓的定价逻辑。因此在做差异归因时，正确的默认假设是&quot;差异可能合法&quot;，回灌（接受渠道值并更新源系统）常常比无脑覆盖更正确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误差预算与告警阈值\">误差预算与告警阈值</h2><p>对账要可运维，必须给差异率设定预算，而不是零容忍。定义一次对账的差异率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>driftRate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mtext>converged</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{driftRate} = \\frac{\\big|\\{c : \\neg \\text{converged}(c)\\}\\big|}{|C|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">driftRate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.526em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">converged</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对它的告警应当分级：少量、可归因到误差型的差异不告警但记录；超过预算（如 0.5%）或出现无法归因的差异则升级为人工工单。关键反模式是<strong>把首次对账的差异率当基线</strong>——首次对账往往包含大量历史遗留的未收敛项，正确做法是先做一轮全量收敛，把稳定的收敛态确立为基线，之后的新增差异才是信号。</p>\n<p>这套机制与分发链路的幂等键、版本指针共同构成闭环：幂等键保证重试安全，版本指针保证知道该重发哪版（见<a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/price-list-versioning-and-snapshot\">价格版本模型与快照</a>），回读比对保证&quot;发出&quot;被证伪为&quot;生效&quot;。三者缺一，价格争议发生时你就答不出那句最关键的话——<strong>渠道此刻挂牌的到底是哪个数，依据哪一版。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-上线前的自检清单\">小结：上线前的自检清单</h2><p>分发失败与对账不是一个功能，而是一组必须同时成立的约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>失败状态是否区分了硬失败 / 软失败 / 超时不确定 / 静默漂移 / 部分成功五态</li>\n<li>幂等键是否由 <code>snapshot_id ‖ channel ‖ scope</code> 导出，且有匹配对端延迟的去重窗口</li>\n<li>重试是否有指数退避加抖动，且确定性拒绝的错误直接进死信队列而非无限重试</li>\n<li>是否有周期性回读对账，而不是只信投递返回码</li>\n<li>差异是否有归因分类，并映射到覆盖 / 回灌 / 接受三种处置</li>\n<li>容忍度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是否按渠道与币种分别标定，而非全局一个数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任一条缺失，都会让&quot;分发成功&quot;这个结论在下一次价格争议里崩塌。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分发失败与对账","id":"分发失败与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：投递、生效与收敛是三件事","id":"核心概念-投递-生效与收敛是三件事"},{"level":2,"text":"失败的五种形态：从硬失败到静默漂移","id":"失败的五种形态-从硬失败到静默漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等键：让重试不变成重复写入","id":"幂等键-让重试不变成重复写入"},{"level":2,"text":"退避、抖动与死信队列","id":"退避-抖动与死信队列"},{"level":2,"text":"对账：以渠道回读为基线","id":"对账-以渠道回读为基线"},{"level":2,"text":"差异分类学：覆盖、回灌还是接受","id":"差异分类学-覆盖-回灌还是接受"},{"level":2,"text":"误差预算与告警阈值","id":"误差预算与告警阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：上线前的自检清单","id":"小结-上线前的自检清单"}],"prev":{"title":"价目表向渠道分发与同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-approval-distribution/price-list-distribution-and-channel-sync"},"next":{"title":"价格审计轨迹与合规留痕","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-governance/price-audit-trail-and-compliance-evidence"}}